sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BA as Buyer agent
    participant GW as Agent gateway
    participant KYA as KYA service
    participant ERP as ERP SAP or Coupa
    participant POL as Mandate and policy
    participant M as 3-way match
    participant RR as Rail router
    participant C as Compliance
    participant CU as MPC custody
    participant SC as Stablecoin partner
    participant L as Ledger
    participant A as Evidence store
    BA->>GW: Create PO request with signed intent mandate
    GW->>KYA: Verify agent signature and principal
    KYA-->>GW: Agent verified
    GW->>POL: Check mandate limits and supplier
    POL-->>GW: Allowed
    GW->>ERP: Create PO
    ERP-->>GW: PO number
    Note over ERP: Supplier ships and posts goods receipt
    ERP->>M: Invoice received
    M->>ERP: Fetch PO and goods receipt
    M-->>POL: Matched within tolerance and approved in ERP
    POL->>RR: Payment intent
    RR-->>POL: Route stablecoin USDC on supplier choice
    POL->>C: Screen wallet, sanctions and Travel Rule
    C-->>POL: Clear
    POL->>CU: Sign request with policy decision id
    CU->>SC: Send USDC with idempotency key
    SC-->>L: Transaction hash confirmed
    L->>ERP: camt.054 entry, post payment and clear invoice
    POL->>A: Store mandate, decisions, screening and hash
